        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donovan R. Cook III\n- Companies: Walt Disney Television Animation, Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, Mayhem Pictures\n- Products: Return to Never Land, McFarland, USA, 2 Stupid Dogs\n- Topics: Film production, Film distribution, Animation, Directing\n\nFacts:\n- Return to Never Land is a 2002 American animated musical fantasy-adventure film.\n- Return to Never Land is also known as Peter Pan 2 and Peter Pan In: Return to Never Land.\n- Walt Disney Television Animation produced Return to Never Land.\n- Walt Disney Pictures released Return to Never Land, and Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures distributed it.\n- McFarland, USA was co-produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Mayhem Pictures.\n- Donovan R. Cook III is an American film director.\n- Donovan R. Cook III is best known for creating, directing, and producing the animated series 2 Stupid Dogs.\n- Donovan R. Cook III directed the Disney animated feature Return to Never Land.",
